{"branch":"동래점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">동래점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-668f8d83993e950e.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"동래점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-668f8d83993e950e.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>부산 동래구 충렬대로 129-1 한양빌딩 3층</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 지하철</h3><ul class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-line\">부산 1호선</span><span>동래역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">부산 4호선</span><span>동래역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">부산 3호선</span><span>미남역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">부산 4호선</span><span>미남역</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>동래럭키아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>동래럭키아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>광혜병원.미남교차로</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>대우아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>대우아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>동래역</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">일반</span></dt><dd><span>148</span><span>200</span><span>307</span><span>44</span><span>50</span><span>57</span><span>111-1</span><span>121</span><span>127</span><span>189</span><span>46</span><span>100-1</span><span>144</span><span>183(심야)</span><span>73(아침)</span><span>77</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">지선</span></dt><dd><span>8</span></dd